Mock the version.json request in the already-mocked schema-update unit test.

ProviderSchemaManager.update() in v1.58.0 fetches version.json after installing
schemas. test_update_force mocks the schema archive and metadata requests but
leaves this request live. Offline execution changes the last debug log call
and fails its existing assertion. Mock only that remaining response, keeping
all assertions and runtime behavior unchanged.

Source: https://github.com/aws-cloudformation/cfn-lint/blob/v1.58.0/src/cfnlint/schema/manager.py

